{"id":"b7ed7758785c988c","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-partition-notation.md","title":"Partition Notation","display":"df-partition-notation — Partition Notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-partition-notation","aliases":["58-df-partition-notation"],"display":"df-partition-notation — Partition Notation","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-partition-notation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-partition-notation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partition-notation — Partition Notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartitionRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PartitionRelation}_S\\)</span> (partition relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[X]^n\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:|A|=n\\}\\qquad(X\\in V\\land n\\in\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[X]^n\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:|A|=n\\}\\qquad(X\\in V\\land n\\in\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partition\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\mathrm{PartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,n,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land 0&lt;\\mu\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land \\forall c\\in V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^n,\\mu)\\to \\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists\\xi\\in\\mu\\;\\left(|H|=\\lambda\\land \\forall a\\in[H]^n\\;c(a)=\\xi\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partition\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\mathrm{PartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,n,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land 0&lt;\\mu\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land \\forall c\\in V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^n,\\mu)\\to \\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists\\xi\\in\\mu\\;\\left(|H|=\\lambda\\land \\forall a\\in[H]^n\\;c(a)=\\xi\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\kappa\\to(\\lambda)^n_\\mu\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,n,\\mu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\kappa\\to(\\lambda)^n_\\mu\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,n,\\mu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>箭头记号和无序有限子集域现在由断言给出；保留原文件 n、mu 均非零的约定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate; see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (function predicate; see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartitionRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"[X]^n\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:|A|=n\\}\\qquad(X\\in V\\land n\\in\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partition\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\mathrm{PartitionRelation}